% holding-blocked: This original is licence-safe and fully notated, but it has not been played by students. A Grade 5 music teacher must trial the rondo with an improvised B episode over the class drone; a Hindustani music educator must review every use of raga, drone and improvisation language in the lesson; a second score reader must check the notes; and someone must replace the discovery search with an authorized link to Ravi Shankar's 1956 "Raga Jog" recording (a label, archive or official artist page).
